---
// Big editorial statement between sections.
---

<section class="statement" aria-label="Personal statement">
  <div class="container">
    <p data-reveal>
      I treat software like a deadlift.<br />
      Clean setup, no wasted movement,<br />
      and it has to <em>hold under load</em>.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .statement {
    padding-block: clamp(4rem, 10vw, 7rem);
  }
  p {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 5.5vw, 3.6rem);
    font-weight: 800;
    line-height: 1.15;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--text);
  }
  em {
    font-style: normal;
    color: var(--accent);
    position: relative;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  /* Hand-drawn style underline */
  em::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    right: 0;
    bottom: -0.08em;
    height: 0.09em;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: var(--accent);
    opacity: 0.85;
    transform: rotate(-0.6deg);
  }
</style>
